call: erc_faction_split_effect

= Civil society organizations break with ​ERC

After months of voicing out their disagreements, lately so even publicly, the vast majority of Civil society organizations closely tied to our party have broken up with us. The ties of the party with the very people that vote for us, the land and nation we represent, the very "C" of ERC has, now definitely, given up on us and the direction the party has taken. 

- @post_event: We must carry on
